# Input

```scss
@use "sass:math";
$name:data-width;
.module-units {
  width:attr(data-width math.$pi,10px);
  height:attr($name math.$e);
  min-width:attr(#{$name} math.$pi,0);
  max-width:attr(data-width /* unit */math.$pi/* comma */,10px);
  min-height:attr(data-height math.$e // unit
    ,10px);
  max-height:attr(data-height math.$pi
    // close
  );
}

```


# Formatted

```scss
@use "sass:math";
$name: data-width;
.module-units {
	width: attr(data-width math.$pi, 10px);
	height: attr($name math.$e);
	min-width: attr(#{$name} math.$pi, 0);
	max-width: attr(data-width /* unit */ math.$pi /* comma */, 10px);
	min-height: attr(
		data-height
		math.$e // unit
		,
		10px
	);
	max-height: attr(
		data-height
		math.$pi
		// close
	);
}

```
